---
import DefaultLayout from '@layouts/DefaultLayout.astro'
import PageHeader from '@components/PageHeader.astro'
import {
  Form,
  Input,
  Button,
  Textarea,
  Heading,
  Link,
} from 'accessible-astro-components'
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<DefaultLayout title="About">
  <PageHeader title="About" subtitle="Learn more about the Northfield Festival of Music & Speech" bgType="gradient" />
  <section class="my-16">
    <div class="container">
      <Heading level="h2">History of the Festival</Heading>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-32 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-content">
        <p>The Northfield Festival of Music and Speech is an annual competitive arts event held in Birmingham, England, focused on educating and fostering the talents of children and young people. </p>
        <Heading level="h3">Key Milestones & History</Heading>
        <p class="text-lg">
       <ul>
        <li>Establishment & Charity Status: The festival's governing constitution was formally adopted on June 14, 1990 (with subsequent amendments in 1991 and 2003), and it was registered as a UK charity (No. 1003470) on July 19, 1991.</li>
        <li>Mission: Founded to promote public and youth education in the arts, the festival gives participants the chance to perform live before audiences, receive constructive feedback from professional adjudicators, and gain confidence.</li>
        <li>Format & Venue: The event features diverse classes spanning music (strings, vocal, piano) and speech and drama. Over recent years, it has been hosted annually at venues such as Bishop Challoner Catholic College in Birmingham.</li>
        <li>Affiliation: It is a member festival connected with the broader performance arts network via the <a href="https://www.federationoffestivals.org.uk/festivals/615">British and International Federation of Festivals (BIFF)</a>.</li>
       </ul>
        </p>


        <div class="gap-2xs flex items-center">
          <Icon aria-hidden="true" name="lucide:phone" size={20} class="flex-shrink-0" />
          <p>
            <span class="font-bold">Phone:</span>
            <Link href="tel:01214711583">+44 121 471 1583</Link>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-2xs flex items-center">
          <Icon aria-hidden="true" name="lucide:mail" size={20} class="flex-shrink-0" />
          <p>
            <span class="font-bold">Email:</span>
            <Link href="mailto:info@northfieldfestival.org.uk">info@northfieldfestival.org.uk</Link>
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <li>
            <Link href="https://www.facebook.com/NorthfieldFest" isButton isExternal hideIcon animateOnHover animationType="boop">
              <Icon aria-hidden="true" name="lucide:facebook" size={32} />
              <span class="sr-only">Go to our Facebook page, opens in a new tab</span>
            </Link>
          </li>
          <li>
            <Link href="https://x.com/NorthfieldFest" isButton isExternal hideIcon animateOnHover animationType="boop">
              <Icon aria-hidden="true" name="lucide:x" size={32} />
              <span class="sr-only">Go to our X page, opens in a new tab</span>
            </Link>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</DefaultLayout>
